    "name": "F.E.A.S.T",
    "steam_appid": 3823480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/e468a6cade9a883c4455eb70df13cddf.avif?t=1752485267\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/41756bb50826aa1004e2dba6f871cebc.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/0a1a260cbb1d431874f87c02619df045.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes. Also, we must quickly adapt the factory to meet the ever-changing needs of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/122d52a0d439c6bbf34b8378f8799593.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4badaf0c93a40bac96b43a82188feac9.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the food is ready, deliver it to the shrines as offerings to the gods. The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to face the gods\u2019 judgment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/acef082883129b7b670526ce26a02a88.avif?t=1752485267\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/e468a6cade9a883c4455eb70df13cddf.avif?t=1752485267\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/41756bb50826aa1004e2dba6f871cebc.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/2de693aeb8356c3f046f02b046bc0786.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/0a1a260cbb1d431874f87c02619df045.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes. Also, we must quickly adapt the factory to meet the ever-changing needs of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/388eb256701fbd3e2f7ab3f3ac698368.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/122d52a0d439c6bbf34b8378f8799593.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4393fd297f0236a41fe0f08505c5d5e9.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/4badaf0c93a40bac96b43a82188feac9.avif?t=1752485267\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the food is ready, deliver it to the shrines as offerings to the gods. The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to face the gods\u2019 judgment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.poster.avif?t=1752485267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.webm?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/659e567cd6d4cf0b6364aca0cc3bc247.mp4?t=1752485267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/acef082883129b7b670526ce26a02a88.avif?t=1752485267\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
